WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.006
Spirometry interpretation made simple.

2
00:00:03.456 --> 00:00:08.181
A stepwise read of the flow-volume loop, ratios and reversibility testing.

3
00:00:08.631 --> 00:00:11.127
Spirometry confirms airflow limitation.

4
00:00:11.577 --> 00:00:14.457
Symptom burden and exacerbation history guide treatment.

5
00:00:14.907 --> 00:00:20.828
Stopping smoking, vaccination and pulmonary rehabilitation have the largest impact on outcomes.

6
00:00:21.278 --> 00:00:29.265
Long-acting bronchodilators are the foundation; inhaled steroids are added for selected patients with exacerbations and raised eosinophils.
